    "RowId": 33862,
    "Description": "Restores target's HP.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Cure Potency:</span> 16,800\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect:</span> <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Regen</span>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Cure Potency:</span> 5,000\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 15s\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect:</span> Cure potency is doubled when target is under the effect of <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Rehabilitation</span>\nThis action is not affected by attributes."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1551382,
    "RowId": 33863,
    "Description": "Deals damage over time to target and all enemies nearby it.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Potency:</span> 2,460\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 30s\nThis action is not affected by attributes or enhancing effects."
  },
